     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Mark,<div><br></div><div>Yes. If you have an R package that requires external dependencies, you can add support for it by sending a PR to the <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps-package-dependencies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps-package-dependencies/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362766733000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28VE-8BqqohDv5knz9h8aH\">shinyapps-package-dependencies</a> project.</div><div><br></div><div>-Andy</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
